    "checkIntegrity": {
      "version": "prototype-v4-check-integrity",
      "scope": "57 terminal checks: retains previous four repairs and adds ten contract-derived cases. Unit09 accepts clear conflict descriptions and independently excludes masking write conflicts. Prior attempts stay immutable; changed execution identity requires fresh runs and reassessment for units08/09. Bounded browser policy checks remain a separately scoped subset, not terminal engine/persistence checks."
    }
